{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>LazyBuster 是一款結合漫畫風格與即時鏡頭偵測的健身輔助 App，專為容易在家中運動時偷懶的使用者設計。透過前置或後置鏡頭鎖定你的動作範圍，一旦檢測到停止移動超過設定時間，App 便會觸發警報聲響提醒你繼續努力。目前正值限時免費下載期間，原價為 US $0.99，是提升居家鍛鍊自律性的有趣工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-66.webp\">\n<h2>智能鏡頭監控與多模式挑戰</h2>\n<p>功能段落約 80 至 120 字，描述其核心機制：使用者需在螢幕偵測區內保持動作，若靜止過久則自動觸發鬧鐘警告。提供倒數計時挑戰與限制「偷懶次數」的模式，並支援自訂警報音效、調整音量及剪輯音訊檔案。介面採用大膽漫畫風格，記錄連續打卡天數，將「再多休息一下」轉化為需戰勝「懶惰怪獸」的遊戲化體驗，確保運動過程真實且充滿動力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-110-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-111-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-112-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-113-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-114-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-115-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：LazyBuster</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:02:05.641265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":380,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:39:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:34.371782+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:58:22.719757+00:00","content_hash":"7213d80e020ee4c3fbd1e46b75146ef2ba9047c956a65a22dee9dd3617b4a8e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}